\subsection{Environmental Decoherence Floor Characterization}

\textbf{Objective:} Characterize $\eta_{\text{env}}(t)$, the substrate-intrinsic noise term in the generalized decay structure (Conjecture~2, Equation~\ref{eq:decay-generalized}), independent of any semantic-weight contribution.

